sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If a straight line is cut in extreme and mean ratio, then the square on the greater segment added to the half of the whole is five times the square on the half.
----
proof:

Let the straight line *AB* be cut in extreme and mean ratio at the point *C,* and let *AC* be the greater segment. Produce the straight line *AD* in a straight line with *CA,* and make *AD* half of *AB.*

